OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face delays after crash
OL,4,Acloses M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters are facing delays after a
OL,7,Fcrash between a van and a lorry closed
OL,8,Fa section of the M6 in both directions.
OL,10,FThe motorway has been shut been
OL,11,Fjunction 23 in Newton-le-Willows,
OL,12,FMerseyside, and junction 24 in
OL,13,FAshton-in-Makerfield, Greater
OL,14,FManchester, National Highways said.
OL,16,FMerseyside Police said the crash at
OL,17,F22:00 BST on Sunday resulted in a
OL,18,Fvehicle fire with Merseyside Fire and
OL,19,FRescue also at the scene alongside its
OL,20,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
